 r←Test_Input_Misc_025(stopFlag batchFlag);n;⎕TRAP;defMat;res;DT;parms;F;menubar
⍝ Exercise "Input" with a user-defined menubar that is based on the default menubar
 r←∆Failed
 ⎕TRAP←(999 'C' '. ⍝ Deliberate error')(0 'N')

 DT←#.APLGUI.APLGUI.Enums.InputDataTypes

 defMat←0 4⍴0
 defMat⍪←'Name' 'Enter your name:' ''DT.Character

 parms←#.APLGUI.APLGUI.Input.CreateParms
 parms.testMode←1
 menubar←'[View] {view}' ' HTML=F11 : OnView {html}' ' XML=F12 : OnView {xml}',#.APLGUI.APLGUI.Input.GetDefaultMenubar 1
 parms.menubar←menubar
 n←#.APLGUI.APLGUI.Input.Create defMat parms ⍬
 →GoToTidyUp 3≠≢n.menubar.∆List'Menu'
 →GoToTidyUp 8≠≢n.menubar.∆List'MenuItem'

 r←∆OK

∆TidyUp:
 :Trap 0 ⋄ {}n.∆CloseForm ⋄ :EndTrap
⍝Done
